cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and record the full Git commit used for your results."
type: software
license: MIT
title: "CRISP and CLEAR: training and deployment"
authors:
  - family-names: Dikmen
    given-names: İsmail Can
repository-code: "https://github.com/DrCanD/crisp-clear-training-and-deployment"
url: "https://github.com/DrCanD/crisp-clear-training-and-deployment"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code and numerical evidence for continuous-time reset-free
  spiking networks and closed-form local learning. Experiments cover mean-field
  training, sampled inference, sampler sharpening, statistical decision
  certification, time-step transfer, formal identities and FPGA decision cost.
keywords:
  - spiking neural networks
  - neuromorphic computing
  - mean-field training
  - local learning
  - stochastic inference
  - reproducible research
  - FPGA
  - formal verification
